# TypeScript / JavaScript security

**Also obey** `.cursor/rules/security.mdc` — invoke **`security-reviewer`** for serious auth/data-path reviews.

## Secrets

```typescript
// Never hardcode secrets
const apiKey = process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY;
if (!apiKey) throw new Error("OPENAI_API_KEY not configured");
```

Validate deployment secrets at startup (fail fast); never log secrets or tokens.

## Client bundles

Assume anything in client-side bundles can be inspected — gate sensitive operations on the **server** and **validated sessions**.